ation were exposed to BSE prions in the late 1980s and early 1990s through contaminated meat products in the food chain. vCJD differs from other forms of Creutzfeldt-Jakob disease in that abnormal prion protein (PrP) has been detected in tonsil biopsy tissues before death and
