| 20 – 25 | 4.23 ng/mL |
| 26 – 30 | 3.48 ng/mL |
| 31 – 35 | 2.43 ng/mL |
| 36 – 40 | 1.28 ng/mL |
| 40 – 44 | 0.52 ng/mL |
