clear factor 1 alpha and 4 alpha in maturity-onset diabetes of the young and hyperinsulinemic hypoglycemia. Hum Mutat. 2013;34(5):669–685. doi: 10.1002/humu.22279. \\[DOI\\] \\[PubMed\\] \\[Google Scholar\\]
