cysts compared to S/L (Fig. S1A and S1B). Among 12 2i/L-derived and 8 a2i/L-derived ESC lines, 7 and 4 of them respectively contained a subpopulation of haploid cells that can be enriched and maintained through regular fluorescence-activated cell sorting (FACS) (Fig. S1B–D). Consistent with our previous observations (Yang et al., 2012 Generation of genetically modified mice by oocyte injection of androgenetic haploid
