| Personal Decon: | Wash exposed skin thoroughly with soap and water Remove contaminated clothing, double bag and hold for environmental test results Take shower with soap and shampoo at earliest opportunity Refer for medical evaluation if testing of environmental sample not possible in 24 hours | [...] | Personal Decon: | Wash hands and forearms with soap and water |
