plex and different mechanisms of activation.102 Another direct AMPK activator, compound 911, has recently been identified. 911 has been reported to be 5–10-fold more potent than A-769662 in allosterically activating AMPK and preventing dephosphorylation.12 Similarly to A-769662, 991 does not activate AMPK complexes containing the Ser108 mutation of the AMPKβ subunit, suggesting that
