ion. The first, which can be engaged in both necrotic and apoptotic cell death, involves the induction of mitochondrial permeability transition (MPT). This phenomenon was demonstrated some 30 years ago \\[23\\]. It was shown that Ca2+ uptake by mitochondria stimulates drastic changes in mitochondrial morphology and functional activity due to the opening of
