in women. Shortly after the initial linkage studies, a prominent interaction between APOE and sex was reported14. The first large meta-analysis of APOE4 studies confirmed the interaction and found that the effect was most prominent among subjects with one copy of the APOE4 allele and one copy of the risk-neutral APOE3 allele. Women with one APOE4 allele had
