al dysfunctions,28."") neuroinflammation,29."") BBB impairment,30."") and cell death processes.31."") Various signaling pathways become activated in these pathological transitions, and their targeted regulation could serve as a potential therapeutic strategy. Given the complex pathophysiology of ischemic stroke, the accompanying injury and signaling mechanisms should be first identified and then further elucidated to develop
