### Heart disease and stroke statistics–2014 update: a report from the American Heart Association [...] Previous studies observed significant positive associations of TMAO plasma levels with cardiovascular risk , , , the staging and prognosis of heart failure , , impaired glucose tolerance in mice , and recently also colorectal cancer . [...] ### Conclusions

Plasma levels of TMAO are confounded by impaired kidney function and poor metabolic control but are not associated with the history, presence or incidence of symptoms or events of coronary heart disease.

