s [8–10]. [...] For functional characterization, we analysed LPS-induced cytokine production. Following LPS stimulation, IL-10 APCs could produce TNF-α and IL-10, but at amounts less than monocytes or MΦ (Fig. 4b). Like monocytes and MΦ, IL-10 APCs secreted only minimal amounts of IL-12 p40. As expected, the main producers of IL-12 p40 were DC.

