al Truvada [...] risk of SHIV infection (P = 0.04), group 2 had a 15.5-fold lower risk (P = 0.008), and group 3 had a 14.0-fold lower risk (P = 0.01). Risk of SHIV infection in these three groups did not differ significantly from infection risk in monkeys who received daily Truvada PrEP in the earlier trial. In animals who did become infected, viremia was about 10-fold lower than in control animals. Resistant virus did not emerge in animals whose PrEP failed. Garcia-Lerma and coworkers speculated that ""the long
