ortic disease [...] Kobeissi E, Hibino M, Pan H, Aune D. Blood pressure, hypertension and the risk of abdominal aortic aneurysms: a systematic review and meta‐analysis of cohort studies. _Eur J Epidemiol._ 2019;34:547–555.

