the NE release-enhancing effects of desmethylimipramine (Schoffelmeer _et al.,_ 2011). In summary, while our experiments found no effect of insulin on NET in the VTA, insulin likely modulates NET in other brain regions. This discrepancy may be due to decreased NET in the VTA compared
