es that analyzed [...] one month postpartum. 30 In another study of mother-infant pairs ( n = 34), the relation between atopic disease and fatty acid composition of milk obtained at one month postpartum was investigated. 31 Lower content of EPA and total n-3 PUFA was observed in milk from mothers with infants who developed atopic dermatitis within the first year of life. 31 In another cohort ( n = 245), the risk for developing allergic sensitization up to 24 months of age was lower in children consuming milk with
