ating chronic inflammation with [...] signaling also activates _EZH2_ and _SUZ12_, linking EMT with PRC2-mediated epigenetic reprogramming16.""),17.""). In addition to activating _EZH2_ expression, MUC1-C binds directly to EZH2 and promotes H3K27 methylation with repression of tumor suppressor genes16.""),17.""). Potential involvement of MUC1-C in counteracting PRC2-mediated gene repression has been supported by the demonstration that MUC1-C→E2F1 signaling activates the SWI/SNF embryonic stem cell BAF and PBAF chromatin remodeling
