eurons suppressed food [...] To test whether conditional Sirt1 overexpression in mouse POMC or AgRP neurons prevents age-associated weight gain and diet-induced obesity, we created conditional Sirt1 knock-in (KI) mice based on the Rosa26 system [28 Generalized lacZ expression with the ROSA26 Cre reporter strain. Nat Genet 21:70–71"")], crossed with Pomc-Cre mice [29 Leptin receptor signaling in POMC neurons is required for normal body weight homeostasis. Neuron 42:983–991"")] or Agrp-Cre mice [30 Transcriptional regulation
