e 2 (NOS2) produced by either hematopoietic or nonhematopoietic cells is sufficient to prevent exacerbated experimental autoimmune myocarditis. A and B, Representative histology of heart sections of wild-type (A) and _Nos2_−/− (B) mice at day 16 of experimental autoimmune myocarditis. C and D, Quantification of immunopositive cells for CD45 (C) and CD3 (D) antigens on heart sections of mice immunized with α-myosin heavy chain peptide and complete Freund’s adjuvant
