vity in peritumoral tissues, resulting in local estrogen production and EC progression. It has also been demonstrated that _NR5A2_ may positively regulate _MYC_ expression , therefore, the increased _NR5A2_ expression may also contribute to the above-described _MYC_ upregulation in EC-adjacent tissues. Noteworthy, in leiomyomas, a decreased expression of _MYC_ and _NR5A2_ in tumors compared to the corresponding
