e early growth response protein-1 (EGFR-1), peroxisome proliferator-activated receptor-γ (PPAR-γ), tumor protein 53 (Tp53; also known as p53), and human sprout homolog 2 (SPRY2). PTEN transcription can also be repressed. Several transcription factors including c-Jun, nuclear factor kappa B (NF-κB), mitogen-activated protein kinase
