Content: The DESMOND Newly Diagnosed programme which has been adapted for those who have had T2DM for over a year, with a culturally adapted version also available, was tested in a cluster randomised trial in a multi-ethnic population. There was a reduction in HbA1c in the intervention group compared to an increase in the control group, but this did not reach statistical significance. Significant reductions were seen in body weight and BMI over 12 months favouring the intervention compared to control [...] ### BMJ (2008) 
