“We know that their risk of another event is really, really high,” Low Wang said. [...] Dr. Cecilia Low Wang is an expert on diabetes and weight loss drugs. She discusses a new study that found semaglutide — also known as Wegovy — can reduce adverse cardiovascular events in addition to helping people lose weight. Photo: UCHealth.

