Content: Granuloma # Granuloma ### What is a granuloma? #### How serious are granulomas? ### What are the symptoms of granulomas? Granulomas often don’t cause symptoms on their own. You may also have symptoms of an infection that causes granulomas. ### What causes a granuloma to form? If you have an underlying condition that causes granulomas to form, your provider will treat you for that condition. Your provider can tell you what to expect if you have an underlying condition that causes granulomas to form. The best way to take care of yourself is to manage any underlying conditions that cause granulomas to form. * Is an underlying condition causing granulomas? * What can I do about symptoms of granulomas?
