Content: # Granulomas * Granulomas are not cancerous. ## What is a granuloma? You may have a granuloma that bleeds. ## What are the types of granulomas? This type of granuloma develops when your body's immune system reacts to an object or irritant that penetrates your skin or eye. ### Skin granulomas There are several types of granulomas that can affect your skin. ## What causes granulomas? Granulomas can be part of conditions such as: * sarcoidosis — a non-infectious disease that can cause multiple granulomas in the lungs and other parts of your body With skin granulomas, your doctor may only need to examine you to confirm a diagnosis. ### Granuloma annulare ### Are granulomas cancerous? ### ACD A-Z of Skin - Pyogenic Granuloma
