biting a 25% functional deficit in grip strength. In particular, grid hang time (2.25x increase) and rotarod performance (2.5x increase) demonstrated the most striking improvements, suggesting that tirasemtiv may have a greater effect on dynamic activities that involve multiple muscle groups (Figure
