ter-membrane MC gene ∆_tssJ_ mutant [...] and TssL are homologues of the type IV secretion system proteins IcmF and DotU, respectively6.""),24.""),25.""). Finally, the sheath-tube extends from the BP by assembling protomers at the distal end and can span across the cytoplasm prior to contraction11.""). What triggers the contraction of the extended sheath remains elusive, but insertions in the VipA N-terminal linker region can block contraction and result in non-contractile sheath-tube structures locked in the pre-contraction
