echanism how ADAR1 [...] HEK293T. Furthermore, we previously reported the nuclear export of ADAR1p110 to the cytoplasm regulated by MAP kinases during stress response (Sakurai et al. 2017). Although DICER is thought to be engaged in processing of pre-miRNAs in the cytoplasm, import of DICER phosphorylated in response to DNA damage to the nucleus has been also reported (Burger et al. 2017). Accordingly, it is currently not clear where processing of Alu siRNAs takes place within the cell, nor the relative contribution of
