are expressed by keratinocyte (KC)-like post-AIRE mTECs (Wang et al., 2012). However, patients with APECED are not susceptible to pemphigus (Kluger et al., 2013), and thus, the development of pemphigus cannot be solely attributed to impaired thymic _AIRE_ expression, but peripheral
