ópez Flores and his colleagues, who demonstrated that positive ALDH1A1 expression in breast cancer is more frequent in tumors with high TILs. To the best of our knowledge, limited data is available about the correlation between ALDH1A1 expression and TILs in different neoplasms, especially breast cancer . We observed that positive ALDH1A1 expression was
