er antibiotic [...] gut ecosystem of these mice was in a state fully susceptible to CDI. However, once mice were given 6 weeks to recover from cefoperazone treatment, the gut returned to a state of complete colonization resistance against _C. difficile_. To further define the intestinal environment that characterized susceptibility and resistance to _C. difficile_, we treated additional groups of wild-type (WT) C57BL/6 mice with cefoperazone. Following all treatments, animals in each group were split into two
