Open access

Highlights

   •The tuberculosis (TB) risk after antiretroviral treatment (ART) initiation in Europe is studied. 
   •TB peaked within 3 months post ART (14.41/1000 PY). 
   •TB was linked to certain baseline risk factors. 
   •TB risk declined over time but remained above European background. 
   •Thorough TB risk assessment essential at ART onset. 

