lts. ANR’s [...] support to the BASILE project will allow my team to quickly reach its cruising speed in a highly competitive research field that is under-represented in France and Europe. Indeed, this project will allow research and development of currently inexistent diagnostic, prognostic and therapeutic solutions for SLE.
