er.12, 18 The _Aldh2_knockout mouse (_Aldh2_−/−) expresses no detectable ALDH2 protein or enzymatic activity.12 After ethanol administration, _Aldh2_−/− mice have significantly higher levels of blood acetaldehyde than wild-type mice, and exposure to 2 g/kg ethanol for 8 days results in weight loss and increased mortality.19, 20 The _Aldh2_ E487K knockin mouse (_Aldh2_ E487K+/+) has
