a (10–40%) [4, 7, 8]. _ALDH22_ is associated with various kinds of phenotypes [9–14], including disease susceptibility e.g., high-risks of alcohol-related cancer among alcohol-users , immunotherapy, and vaccine sensitivity [10, 11]. The best known is the so-called “Asian flush” phenomenon, in which,
