 by that of BRPF1. An artificial fusion construct comprising the PWWP, CXXC, and AHD domains functioned as an oncogenic transcriptional machinery and induced leukemia in mouse models. Because the PWWP and CXXC domains are sufficient for the stable association with the MLL target promoters, the target chromatin of the MLL
