 line. In this way, the cell class-specific exponents for the long-range DNA methylation correlation reflect the spatial organization of chromatin. We also demonstrate that the local DNA methylation correlation is related to nucleosome occupancy, and suggest that there are different chromatin structures of PMDs and non-PMDs at nucleosome level.
