ne induction in Th2 cells require Ca 2+ mediated NFAT1/2 activation (67). NFAT2 and STAT6 synergistically enhance _Il31_ promoter activity. These studies suggest that NFAT2 plays positive regulatory roles in Th2 inflammation with possible reciprocal relationship with NFAT1 or NFAT4.
