Scientists have elucidated the role of the gene _Nr5a2_ in the first stages of embryonic development in mammals. This research sheds new light on a biological process that is not yet fully understood. [...] Nicola Festuccia 1 , Sandrine Vandormael-Pournin 1, Almira Chervova 1, Anna Geiselmann 1,2, Francina Langa-Vives 3, Rémi-Xavier Coux 1, Inma Gonzalez 1, Guillaume Giraud Collet 1,4, Michel Cohen-Tannoudji 1†, Pablo Navarro 1†

