As may be involved in. [...] According to references and our interest, six mRNAs from the results of RNA-seq were selected for further validation by using qRT-PCR analysis. Compared with the Ad-GFP group, Hmgn5, Nr5a2, Dll4, Entpd1, and Brms1 displayed a decreased expression, and Fam50a displayed an increased expression in the Ad-CD36–005 group (p < 0.05) (Fig.6). These results showed that the qRT-PCR results of expression levels of all six mRNAs confirmed were consistent with the RNA-seq data.

