or poor TB [...] panel. A. The top panel of a nodule caseum and cavity lesion resected 20 h after LZD administration. LZD partitions favorably into cavity and nodule caseum in vivo, as indicated by the green color present in caseum and surrounding tissue showing similar concentrations in both. B. Clofazimine at steady state and 5 h post dose shows low penetration into the large necrotic granuloma in the top panel, as indicated by the blue area. CFZ, clofazimine; LZD, linezolid; MALDI-MS, matrix-assisted laser
