el, the [...] Representative images of control and Arp2/3 complex–inhibited conditions are seen in Figure 5, A and C. In the Arp2/3 complex–inhibited condition, no lamellipodia were present, and all adhesions around the cell perimeter were found in the FLPs. The number of FAs per lamellipodium was ∼37 on average with 89 as maximum and 6 as minimum (Figure 5B). Therefore, the average lamellipodium was most similar to the 30 FA condition in the PFA model, which resulted in the highest forces. In the
