rticle;  We [...] Following s.c. inoculation with 10 2 PFU of WNV (New York 2000 strain), _Ifnar fl/fl Gfap-_ Cre+ mice had accelerated and enhanced mortality (16.7% vs. 50.0% survival; Figure 1A) and greater clinical signs of disease (Figure 1B) compared with _Ifnar fl/fl_ Cre– controls. In contrast, survival after WNV infection was unaffected in _Ifnar fl/WT_ _Gfap_-Cre+ littermates or in congenic _Gfap_-Cre+ mice that had never been crossed with the _Ifnar fl/fl_ line. As expected, viral burden did not differ
