thermore, the DP Treg cell subset was the most proliferative Treg cell subset before and during low-dose IL-2 immunotherapy, compared with CD38+ and HLA-DR+ Treg cells, while proliferation was minimal in CD45RA+ and DN Treg cells (Figure 4G). CD38+ Treg cells carried proteins associated with suppression, including CTLA-4 and LAG3 (Figure 4F).44 HLA-DR+ Treg cells expressed increased CD39 and a tendency to increased _TGFB1_,
