cell functions and in vivo [...] Moreover, YAP silencing decreased cell viability of Bcl-2 overexpressing clone plated on 50 kPa gel (Fig. 7E, F, Supplementary Fig S6), indicating the involvement of YAP in the ability of Bcl-2 to promote cell viability in higher stiffness condition.
