rity (Zhao & Blobel, 2005; Ampatzidou _et al_, 2006; Branzei _et al_, 2006; Potts _et al_, 2006; Pebernard _et al_, 2008b; Behlke‐Steinert _et al_, 2009; Chavez _et al_, 2010; Bermúdez‐López _et al_, 2015). As Nse2 lacks DNA binding domains, its DNA repair functions require its stable docking onto the Smc5 protein (Duan _et al_, 2009; Bermúdez‐López _et al_, 2015), and the subsequent association of the
