Title: TNFAIP3 (tumor necrosis factor, alpha-induced protein 3)
URL: https://atlasgeneticsoncology.org/gene/42600/tnfaip3-(tumor-necrosis-factor-alpha-induced-protein-3)
Content: TNFAIP3 has been identified as a tumor suppressor gene in PMBL by showing frequent somatic and clonal biallelic inactivation of the gene . Loss of TNFAIP3 function contributes to the constitutive activity of the transcription factor NFKB and the survival and/or proliferation of the cells.
