Byers RJ, Currie T, Tholouli E, Rodig SJ, Kutok JL. MSI2 protein expression predicts unfavorable outcome in acute myeloid leukemia. Blood. 2011; 118:2857–2867. [PubMed: 21753187] [...] Sison EA, McIntyre E, Magoon D, Brown P. Dynamic Chemotherapy-Induced Upregulation of CXCR4 Expression: A Mechanism of Therapeutic Resistance in Pediatric AML. Molecular cancer research : MCR. 2013; 11:1004–1016. [PubMed: 23754844] 

