##### DdrB Modulates the Formation of RecA Protein Filaments [...] 20.8-kDa DdrB is the actual version expressed in _D. radiodurans_. The corrected _ddrB_ nucleotide sequence data reported are available in the Third Party Annotation Section of the DDBJ/EMBL/GenBank TM databases under the accession number TPA: BK006794.
