Content: This guidance describes the overview and future direction of ultrasonography for acute care physicians and can be utilized for emergency ultrasound education. This guidance describes the overview and future direction of ultrasonography for acute care physicians and can be utilized for emergency ultrasound education in Japan. It is important to note that this guidance does not correspond to a guideline that shows the level of evidence or recommendation based on systematic reviews but rather outlines the direction and approach for acute care physicians, considering validation articles on existing ultrasound examinations or POCUS in emergency medicine and the current situation of dissemination of POCUS in emergency medicine in Japan. * 340Dargent A, Chatelain E, Kreitmann L, Quenot J-P, Cour M, Argaud L, et al.
